S-BIAD1055, DOI 10.6019/S-BIAD1055, Talon Chandler and collaborators,
"Volumetric imaging of the 3D orientation of cellular structures with a polarized
fluorescence light-sheet microscope", associated with PNAS
DOI 10.1073/pnas.2406679122. The archive metadata explicitly identifies Creative
