https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

Changes to data representation: exact lossless extraction of the author's
predefined registered analysis ROI; same-session author's central calibration
cube; TIFF counts converted without resampling to batch-first NPZ arrays.
The original registered observations already include author deskewing and
registration. Whole original observation TIFF hashes are not claimed because
only public byte ranges were retrieved; every retrieved range, selected native
complete-plane verification, ROI array hash and full calibration-file hash is
indexed in private provenance. No target reconstruction is released as an input.

